{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A cube has a volume of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/523c7d52aacfb9bfea1996485cb75e33e307aee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125 \\text{cm}^3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> What is the area of one face of the cube?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e813434524a17ff7bdc8b52d1511ca474fc8f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 20 \\text{cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 25 \\text{cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 41 \\dfrac{2}{3} \\text{cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5 \\text{cm}^2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 75 \\text{cm}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"522\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The side length of the cube is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/c/71cf3194b741b507a1817b0ce39747eef4fa67b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{125} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> cm, so the area of one face is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b64b461872ab237c74c8b1e8ae47a4a58abcd6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 = 25 \\text{cm}^2.$\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f85b42a7bfab353d6868ac300073cda7020e71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" t